# Code review

When reviewing changes in this repository:

- Read `guides/ai/review-checklist.md` and follow it, including its reporting format.
- Read `guides/ai/known-traps.md` and the guides or ADRs for the areas the change touches.
- Don't edit files or post to GitHub during a review unless asked.
